From {{bor|en|fr|hydraulique}}, from {{der|en|la|hydraulicus}}, from {{der|en|grc|ὑδραυλικός||of a water organ}}, from {{m|grc|ὕδραυλις||water organ}}, from {{af|grc|ὕδωρ|gloss1=water|αὐλός|gloss2=pipe|nocat=1}}.

{{ety|en|:bor|la:prōiectus}}
From {{bor|en|la|prōiectus}}, perfect passive participle of {{m|la|prōiciō||throw forth, extend; expel}}.

